     Rational[1, 2] 
    Abs[$CellContext`\[Lambda]]^(-1) (
     8 (4 + $CellContext`\[Lambda])^Rational[1, 2] 
      Abs[$CellContext`\[Lambda]] C[1] + Complex[0, 1] C[2]), 0, 
    Rational[1, 4] (-2 + $CellContext`\[Lambda]) (4 + $CellContext`\[Lambda])^
     Rational[-1, 2] (
      2 + $CellContext`\[Lambda] - $CellContext`\[Lambda]^
